OL,3,GNEWSAArson attack causes 'devastating'
OL,4,Adamage to club
OL,5,
OL,6,FA fire started deliberately has caused
OL,7,F"devastating" damage to a sports and
OL,8,Fsocial club, its committee has said.
OL,10,FWalton Sports and Social Club's lounge
OL,11,Fand tap room were destroyed by the
OL,12,Fblaze on Friday. No one was hurt in the
OL,13,Ffire.
OL,15,FThe committee, which has run the club
OL,16,Fon Shay Lane, Wakefield, since it
OL,17,Fopened as a miners' welfare in the
OL,18,F1960s, said a crowdfunder had already
OL,19,Fbeen launched and they were overwhelmed
OL,20,Fwith the response.
OL,23,APub: 08-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
