OL,3,GNEWSAArson attack causes 'devastating'
OL,4,Adamage to club
OL,5,
OL,6,FDet Insp Steve Sayles, of West
OL,7,FYorkshire Police, said it was a
OL,8,Fdeliberately targeted attack and could
OL,9,Fhave been "significantly worse". The
OL,10,Fforce has released CCTV images of a man
OL,11,Fit wants to speak to as part of its
OL,12,Finvestigation.
